        "notes": "In the game, you will have the option to nuke any country you like, and this could be considered criminal behavior.\r\n\r\nAlso, you will be able to book time to 'hang out' with expensive adult film stars for when you land in DC. This can be accessed from a fake parody website in the game. Their clothing is slightly risque.\r\n\r\nMild suggestive AI-Generated Gay art.\r\n\r\nYou can use your flamethrower on agents and 'kill' them. However, they are just 'male maid robots' so technically you're just frying their circuits."
    },
